Data-source notes:

- scripts/bq_first_seen.py queries Google BigQuery PUBLIC datasets
  (`bigquery-public-data.crypto_ethereum` and
  `bigquery-public-data.goog_blockchain_tron_mainnet_us`) at run time,
  under the user's own Google Cloud project and billing. No data from
  those datasets ships in this repository; use is subject to the
  datasets' own terms.
- scripts/athena_first_seen.py renders the shipped SQL templates against
  a warehouse the USER configures (database, workgroup and region are
  required parameters with no defaults). No warehouse data ships here.

This repository ships NO datasets: no event registry, no address lists,
no detector scores, no first-seen indices, no model weights and no
threshold values (see README "Boundary"). Every input is a parameter the
user supplies; warehouse configuration is fail-closed.

Outputs derived from CC-BY-NC sources (e.g. OpenSanctions) or BSL-licensed
sources (e.g. Dune Spellbook) must not be added to this repository.
